msgid "游戏语言"
msgstr "Game Language"

msgid "简体中文"
msgstr "Simplified Chinese"

msgid "繁体中文"
msgstr "Traditional Chinese"

msgid "国际服请设置为繁体中文"
msgstr "Set this to Traditional Chinese for the international server."

msgid ""
"1. 自动战斗依赖按键识别，请在游戏设置中打开快捷键显示，提升出牌准确率。\n"
"2. 国际服玩家请将本模式配置中的\"游戏语言\"设置为繁体中文。"
msgstr ""
"1. Auto battle relies on shortcut recognition. Enable shortcut display in the game settings for better accuracy.\n"
"2. International server players should set Game Language to Traditional Chinese in this mode."

msgid ""
"1. 请主动打开游戏内自动战斗和自动剧情功能。\n"
"2. 国际服玩家请将本模式配置中的\"游戏语言\"设置为繁体中文。"
msgstr ""
"1. Enable auto battle and auto story in the game.\n"
"2. International server players should set Game Language to Traditional Chinese in this mode."

msgid "遇到章鱼暂停"
msgstr "Pause when an octopus appears"

msgid "识别到章鱼后检查并尝试关闭游戏自动战斗，暂停工具并提醒。手动打完后停在奖励、结算或路线页面，点击工具全局开始按钮继续。"
msgstr "When an octopus is detected, check and try to turn off in-game auto battle, then pause the tool and notify you. Finish the battle manually, stay on a reward, settlement, or route screen, and click the global Start button to resume."

msgid "自动开启噩梦模式"
msgstr "Automatically enable Nightmare mode"

msgid "每轮在配置队伍页面检查噩梦开关，关闭时开启；无法确认状态时暂停。关闭此选项则不操作游戏内开关。"
msgstr "Check the Nightmare switch on the team setup screen each run and enable it if off. Pause if its state cannot be confirmed. Disable this option to leave the in-game switch unchanged."

msgid "首层结束策略"
msgstr "First-floor completion strategy"

msgid "自动逃离"
msgstr "Automatically escape"

msgid "目标装备达标时暂停"
msgstr "Pause when target equipment count is reached"

msgid "暂停所需目标装备数量"
msgstr "Target equipment count required to pause"

msgid "仅在开启“只打第一层”时生效。默认自动逃离；选择“目标装备达标时暂停”后，首层结束时目标装备数量达标则暂停，否则自动逃离。装备达标暂停优先于首层闪光重刷。"
msgstr "Only applies when First Floor Only is enabled. Escape automatically by default. With the target equipment strategy, pause at the end of the first floor if the required count is reached; otherwise escape. Equipment-based pausing takes priority over restarting for a missing first-floor Flash."

msgid "取值1～3。统计刷存档主战员当前已装备且命中对应装备位优先级列表的装备，每个装备位计1件。"
msgstr "Range: 1-3. Count equipment currently worn by the save-data target character that matches the priority list for its slot. Each slot counts as one item."

msgid "装备选择策略"
msgstr "Equipment selection strategy"

msgid "原有策略"
msgstr "Original strategy"

msgid "仅目标主战员列表装备"
msgstr "Only listed equipment for the target character"

msgid "原有策略：优先给刷存档主战员升级，否则随机给队友。仅目标主战员列表装备：只安装对应装备位优先级列表内且符合原有替换规则的装备，不分配给队友；其余提炼，商店中则取消购买。"
msgstr "Original strategy: prioritize upgrades for the save-data target character, then randomly equip teammates. Target-only strategy: equip only items listed for their slot that satisfy the existing replacement rules. Refine other items, or cancel their purchase in shops, instead of equipping teammates."

msgid "得到指定装备后暂停"
msgstr "Pause after obtaining the specified equipment"

msgid "填写装备名称后，安装或购买到该装备时暂停并提醒。留空则不暂停。无需完整名称，填写能区分的关键字即可。被提炼或取消购买时不会暂停。"
msgstr "Pause and notify after this equipment is installed or purchased. Leave blank to disable. A distinctive keyword is enough. Refining the item or canceling its purchase does not pause."

msgid "刷章鱼装备"
msgstr "Farm a specific octopus equipment"

msgid "填写目标装备名称，例如混沌之识。战胜章鱼的这一关里，每件装备都会和该名称比较；回到路线时如果一件都没对上，就退出并重新开局。留空则不启用。无需完整名称，关键字即可。与“遇到章鱼暂停”可同时使用。"
msgstr "Enter the target equipment name, for example Chaos Cognition. Every equipment drop in the stage where the octopus is defeated is compared with this name. If none match when the route returns, quit and start a new run. Leave blank to disable. A distinctive keyword is enough. This can be used together with pausing for the octopus."

msgid "每项写成“卡牌名*次数”，例如展开极光*2、剑雨*1。优先复制还没达到次数、并且当前画面里有的第一张。当前画面没有这张卡时，改复制后面还没达到次数的卡。列表里的卡都找不到，或次数都已达到，就跳过，不复制其他卡牌。一次要选多张时，只选同一张还能覆盖本次张数的卡。只写卡牌名时无限复制。次数每局重新计算。"
msgstr "Write each entry as “card name*count”, for example 展开极光*2 and 剑雨*1. Copy the first listed card that is on screen and still has copies left. If it is absent, copy the next listed card that still has copies left. If none of the listed cards are present, or every count is already reached, skip and do not copy another card. When several cards must be selected, use only one card that can cover the whole selection. A name without a count is copied without limit. Counts reset every run."

msgid "闪光拉黑列表"
msgstr "Flash blacklist"

msgid "填写描述关键字。如果闪光选项出现该描述，则不选择这个闪光。关键字写法和“闪光优先级”相同，按卡牌名加描述的原文顺序填写，部分关键字即可。列表为空时不启用拉黑。"
msgstr "Enter description keywords. If a flash option shows that description, do not select it. Use the same keyword style as Flash Priority: card name plus description in the original order, and partial keywords are enough. An empty list disables the blacklist."

msgid "界面调试"
msgstr "Screen debug"

msgid "每个界面截图"
msgstr "Screenshot each screen"

msgid ""
"开启后，卡厄思、出击和剧情模式每次进入新的游戏界面时保存一张截图。\n"
"截图保存在 page_screenshots 目录，与 screenshots 分开，启动时不会清空。\n"
"同一界面连续停留只保存一次，离开后再进入会再保存。"
msgstr ""
"When enabled, Chaos, Sortie, and Story modes save one screenshot each time a new game screen is entered.\n"
"Images are stored in the page_screenshots directory, separate from screenshots, and are not cleared on startup.\n"
"Staying on the same screen does not create another image; leaving and returning does."
